{"id":"8fb20612c81df063","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-ifp-lfp.md","title":"有限结构上 IFP 与 LFP 等表达力","display":"thm-ifp-lfp — 有限结构上 IFP 与 LFP 等表达力","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-ifp-lfp","aliases":["29-thm-ifp-lfp"],"display":"thm-ifp-lfp — 有限结构上 IFP 与 LFP 等表达力","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-ifp]]","[[29-df-fo-lfp]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Corollary 9.8, p.143, DjVu scan 158","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-ifp-lfp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-ifp-lfp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ifp-lfp — 有限结构上 IFP 与 LFP 等表达力"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ad67d470dcdc91b8\" href=\"?note=ad67d470dcdc91b8\" title=\"29-df-fo-ifp\">29-df-fo-ifp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8799e17a4ba0440\" href=\"?note=d8799e17a4ba0440\" title=\"29-df-fo-lfp\">29-df-fo-lfp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Corollary 9.8, p.143, DjVu scan 158"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为任意有限词汇；结构只取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，不添加内建线性序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>两种逻辑的句子与满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad67d470dcdc91b8\" href=\"?note=ad67d470dcdc91b8\" title=\"29-df-fo-ifp\">29-df-fo-ifp</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d8799e17a4ba0440\" href=\"?note=d8799e17a4ba0440\" title=\"29-df-fo-lfp\">29-df-fo-lfp</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IFP},\\mathrm{LFP}\">\\(\\mathrm{IFP},\\mathrm{LFP}\\)</span> 分别标记 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ad67d470dcdc91b8\" href=\"?note=ad67d470dcdc91b8\" title=\"29-df-fo-ifp\">29-df-fo-ifp</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d8799e17a4ba0440\" href=\"?note=d8799e17a4ba0440\" title=\"29-df-fo-lfp\">29-df-fo-lfp</a> 的句子及满足关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(IFP)}}[\\tau]\\}\n=\\{\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\psi\\}\\mid\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{IFP}}\\phi\\}\\mid\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(IFP)}}[\\tau]\\}\n=\\{\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathrm{LFP}}\\psi\\}\\mid\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{FO(LFP)}}[\\tau]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary 9.8，印刷页 143，扫描页 158。已核对陈述及前后说明；一般 IFP 到正 LFP 的翻译依赖该节阶段比较论证，本次未逐式重验整个 Theorem 9.3 证明。等式表示查询的等表达力，不表示两套语法树集合字面相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-ifp","status":"resolved","id":"ad67d470dcdc91b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-ifp]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-lfp","status":"resolved","id":"d8799e17a4ba0440","anchor":"ref-2",